WEBVTT

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:12.680
Sosuke...!

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:16.830
What... happened to him?!

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:18.450
We're not entirely certain.

00:00:18.890 --> 00:00:23.370
But both his pulse and his breathing 
are gradually growing faint...

00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:25.280
No...!

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:32.460
Satomi, doesn't this mean

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:37.360
that Sosuke's Gem of Duty 
has chosen Ao as its owner?

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:39.390
It's quite likely.

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:43.000
With only half a soul, Sosuke's 
very existence has been precarious.

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:45.640
Before long,

00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:48.770
his fragmented soul will get 
dragged into the Afterworld.

00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:53.710
It's my fault.

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:55.900
Shino?

00:00:56.220 --> 00:01:00.410
I let Ao steal Sosuke's gem...

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:04.060
So...

00:01:04.520 --> 00:01:05.750
Wake up!

00:01:06.320 --> 00:01:07.790
I still...

00:01:08.170 --> 00:01:09.790
haven't apologized to you.

00:01:10.650 --> 00:01:12.940
Not over how Ao stole your gem from me.

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:14.940
Not to mention...

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:17.590
Then deal with it yourself!

00:01:22.700 --> 00:01:25.410
Shino? Where are you going?

00:01:29.080 --> 00:01:31.980
He means to find the man 
who stole the gem...

00:03:10.230 --> 00:03:14.700
Pursuit

00:03:10.760 --> 00:03:11.900
Kokonoe...

00:03:14.110 --> 00:03:14.960
And over there.

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:20.790
Was this area always so lively 
during the daylight hours?

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:24.580
It feels as though they are 
converging in the Imperial Capital.

00:03:29.830 --> 00:03:31.370
What happened to him?

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:32.850
The blood had drained from his face.

00:03:37.840 --> 00:03:39.610
Ao! Are you around?

00:03:42.340 --> 00:03:43.960
Damn it!

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:46.240
And here he always pops up 
whenever I don't need him!

00:03:52.940 --> 00:03:54.020
Sosuke!

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:07.190
A man with one eye golden 
and the other not?

00:04:07.730 --> 00:04:09.800
No, I've never seen him.

00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:11.790
Thanks.

00:04:17.800 --> 00:04:19.900
I just so happen to know that man.

00:04:30.980 --> 00:04:33.350
Hey, aren't you a spirit?

00:04:35.810 --> 00:04:38.420
Goodness! You could tell?

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:42.300
I figured a spirit might 
know where he was.

00:04:43.150 --> 00:04:45.100
That's why I was willing to 
keep quiet and follow you.

00:04:45.100 --> 00:04:46.300
Now start talking.

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:49.300
I'd rather not.

00:04:49.830 --> 00:04:54.300
Instead, I am going 
to make a meal of you!

00:04:57.940 --> 00:04:58.840
Keno?!

00:05:01.630 --> 00:05:03.440
Oh? Fascinating!

00:05:03.880 --> 00:05:06.090
You possess the Demon Princess' heart!

00:05:07.430 --> 00:05:10.080
Then I will consume you first!

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:13.720
Keno!

00:05:13.720 --> 00:05:15.960
I wanna ask her somethin' 
before you kill her!

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:18.210
I don't have that kind of leeway!

00:05:22.990 --> 00:05:27.780
Not rats! Rats! Keno, the rats-!

00:05:27.780 --> 00:05:28.970
Quit screaming like a girl!

00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:30.600
Rats!

00:05:33.510 --> 00:05:35.590
I won't let you get away!

00:05:43.130 --> 00:05:45.030
Kaede, what are you doing here?

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:47.850
I came after you under 
Nachi's instructions.

00:05:48.470 --> 00:05:51.080
Scatter, you filthy rats!

00:05:53.480 --> 00:05:54.330
Stand aside!

00:05:54.850 --> 00:05:55.770
Murasame!

00:05:58.020 --> 00:06:00.580
I'm going to ask once more: Where is Ao?

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:03.700
Shut up and let me devour you!

00:06:10.950 --> 00:06:12.890
Kokonoe was just telling me how

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:16.980
it feels as though the spirits are 
converging in the Imperial Capital.

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:21.000
Dearie, shouldn't you avoid 
going outdoors right now?

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:22.590
Not an option!

00:06:22.590 --> 00:06:24.160
I can't afford...

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:26.750
to sit and twiddle my thumbs!

00:06:27.220 --> 00:06:29.150
It wouldn't make that 
darling doll happy

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:32.430
if something were to happen to you 
when you're trying to help him!

00:06:35.880 --> 00:06:37.950
Kaede, please!

00:06:37.950 --> 00:06:40.090
Hunt down Sosuke's gem!

00:06:40.090 --> 00:06:41.260
What?!

00:06:41.260 --> 00:06:44.980
Couldn't you pick up on his gem's aura?

00:06:44.980 --> 00:06:46.260
That's where I'll find Ao!

00:06:47.070 --> 00:06:47.890
Please!

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:54.260
Fine! But don't get your hopes up.

00:06:55.910 --> 00:06:57.270
Thank you!

00:06:58.870 --> 00:07:02.770
A bunch of nasty critters 
are flocking here.

00:07:14.560 --> 00:07:17.060
We've been the talk of the 
Imperial Capital of late.

00:07:17.640 --> 00:07:20.000
People are claiming that the area 
around this church is amiss.

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:24.170
Wouldn't it be a pain if 
they brought the army?

00:07:25.730 --> 00:07:29.490
I simply... cannot stand a dull moment.

00:07:31.280 --> 00:07:33.180
Eh?! Sosuke did?

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:35.240
What brought this on so suddenly?

00:07:35.240 --> 00:07:38.680
Sosuke didn't look like he was ill.

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:43.310
Uh, actually, he may have 
been sick for a long time...

00:07:43.670 --> 00:07:46.300
He always tries to keep that 
sort of thing a secret.

00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:49.690
That is how brothers are.

00:07:50.630 --> 00:07:52.700
They try not to give cause for concern.

00:07:53.220 --> 00:07:54.830
"Brothers," huh?

00:07:55.390 --> 00:07:59.200
Huh? Shino, you and Sosuke 
aren't brothers, are you?

00:07:59.640 --> 00:08:02.230
Blood relations are not the 
only bonds people make.

00:08:12.860 --> 00:08:16.570
He's always looking out for me.

00:08:17.410 --> 00:08:20.650
He casts his own needs aside, 
never putting himself first.

00:08:25.130 --> 00:08:26.710
Whoa, a giant cat!

00:08:27.090 --> 00:08:28.860
My, a puny child!

00:08:30.210 --> 00:08:32.860
You'll be sorry if you confuse 
me with some house cat-

00:08:33.180 --> 00:08:34.130
Hey!

00:08:34.130 --> 00:08:35.660
You'd better not try to eat me!

00:08:36.550 --> 00:08:39.710
That looks just like a kitty cat 
playing with a giant ball of fluff...

00:08:37.140 --> 00:08:38.480
Tch! You little...!

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:40.100
Really, of all the nerve!

00:08:41.230 --> 00:08:43.650
Kaede, did you find it?

00:08:44.100 --> 00:08:47.460
Yes, I can sense eight gems 
within the Imperial Capital.

00:08:47.780 --> 00:08:49.630
Which means Ao is here...

00:08:50.030 --> 00:08:53.130
One seems to be in the Old 
Castle District's church.

00:08:53.610 --> 00:08:54.700
The church?

00:08:55.390 --> 00:08:57.450
And from the looks of it,

00:08:57.450 --> 00:09:00.390
spirits are starting to 
gather around that church.

00:09:03.790 --> 00:09:04.950
Hold it!

00:09:04.950 --> 00:09:07.840
Do you plan on barging into 
a place that is essentially

00:09:07.840 --> 00:09:09.230
a lair packed with spirits?

00:09:09.220 --> 00:09:10.590
You bet I do!

00:09:10.960 --> 00:09:12.050
Shino!

00:09:12.050 --> 00:09:13.720
Natsume, let's go.

00:09:13.720 --> 00:09:15.470
What?! You're going with him?!

00:09:15.830 --> 00:09:19.120
Shino is not the only one 
worried about Sosuke.

00:09:19.680 --> 00:09:22.590
And Sosuke isn't the only 
one I'm worried about.

00:09:23.430 --> 00:09:26.620
If he is there, then 
naturally, I'm going.

00:09:27.100 --> 00:09:31.190
Kaede, inform Genpachi and 
Kobungo of the situation.

00:09:31.980 --> 00:09:34.260
Wait, wait! Is that any 
way to ask a person

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:37.550
- scratch that - a 
Scared Beast a favor?!

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:39.010
Really!

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:43.080
Keep your chompers to yourself!

00:09:44.410 --> 00:09:45.810
Really, of all the...!

00:09:52.840 --> 00:09:54.490
Shino is going to the 
Old Castle District?

00:09:55.090 --> 00:09:56.500
With the recent onslaught of

00:09:56.500 --> 00:09:59.130
violent deaths and missing 
persons around there,

00:09:59.130 --> 00:10:01.490
even the military police 
are wary of that district.

00:10:02.140 --> 00:10:04.050
I can't believe he went 
there of all places...

00:10:04.430 --> 00:10:07.500
He must not be thinkin' straight 
since Sosuke collapsed.

00:10:08.310 --> 00:10:11.860
Kaede, please pass this information 
along to Satomi and the others.

00:10:11.860 --> 00:10:12.750
Eh?!

00:10:13.610 --> 00:10:14.630
Me again?!

00:10:15.070 --> 00:10:17.340
Hey, Bro! Wait for me!

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:21.890
Hey! I'm not a messenger cat! Jeez!

00:10:22.910 --> 00:10:27.390
Yana explained the situation 
when I dropped by the dorms.

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:29.830
How is Sosuke holding up?

00:10:29.830 --> 00:10:31.980
It was nice of you to bring this,

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:34.310
but he can't eat anything right now...

00:10:34.590 --> 00:10:35.760
Then Shino can-

00:10:35.760 --> 00:10:38.300
That runt has run off for 
the Old Castle District.

00:10:39.300 --> 00:10:41.910
Word just came in from Kaede.

00:10:42.640 --> 00:10:43.910
The Old Castle District?

00:10:44.180 --> 00:10:48.760
Wasn't the church there closed 
down under Headquarters' orders?

00:10:48.760 --> 00:10:52.580
Seeing how it's turnin' into a 
lair bustling with spirits...

00:10:53.110 --> 00:10:57.000
I had a feeling the geezers at 
Headquarters were scheming something.

00:10:57.740 --> 00:10:59.420
I'm going to tell Rio.

00:10:59.420 --> 00:11:01.200
Kaname, you stay here.

00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:01.930
All right.

00:11:02.370 --> 00:11:03.250
Um...

00:11:06.120 --> 00:11:09.650
Got it! You're worried 
about Shino, right?

00:11:09.650 --> 00:11:10.420
Huh?

00:11:10.420 --> 00:11:12.330
You can leave him to me!

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:15.290
Uh, don't push yourself too hard...

00:11:23.680 --> 00:11:25.330
It looks like no one is here.

00:11:25.850 --> 00:11:27.990
No, it's teeming with spirits.

00:11:29.230 --> 00:11:30.190
They're in the basement.

00:11:35.990 --> 00:11:38.940
What type of room should 
we expect up ahead?

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:40.340
A catacomb, probably.

00:11:40.780 --> 00:11:43.140
Shinobu, don't let your guard down.

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:44.460
This place feels ominous.

00:12:07.510 --> 00:12:10.370
Shino, so you came.

00:12:15.730 --> 00:12:16.820
Ao!

00:12:20.190 --> 00:12:21.260
That eye...!

00:12:21.700 --> 00:12:25.200
Yeah. It looks like Sosuke 
and I are swapping places.

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:26.540
Don't give me that bullshit!

00:12:26.540 --> 00:12:28.010
Give Sosuke's gem back!

00:12:28.490 --> 00:12:30.260
Don't you see?

00:12:30.750 --> 00:12:32.770
The gem chose me.

00:12:33.210 --> 00:12:35.820
I'm not gonna let it choose you!

00:12:35.820 --> 00:12:37.650
Welcome!

00:12:37.650 --> 00:12:38.770
I have been waiting for you.

00:12:44.220 --> 00:12:45.410
You're...!

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:47.150
Were you...

00:12:49.470 --> 00:12:51.920
...the model for that doll Pa carved...?

00:13:01.650 --> 00:13:03.380
I am Tamazusa.

00:13:04.990 --> 00:13:06.140
Tamazusa?

00:13:06.740 --> 00:13:10.640
You are welcome guests, 
Princess Fuse's Dog Warriors.

00:13:25.470 --> 00:13:27.660
Daikaku, be careful.

00:13:28.260 --> 00:13:31.910
Ao, I'm going to say this again:
Give Sosuke's gem back.

00:13:32.390 --> 00:13:33.580
Not happening.

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:35.660
This gem belongs to me now.

00:13:36.230 --> 00:13:40.040
Then I'll take it back by force!

00:13:42.440 --> 00:13:45.150
Are you serious about 
killing me this time?

00:13:45.150 --> 00:13:47.180
Sosuke's life is on the line!

00:13:47.660 --> 00:13:48.930
Didn't I warn you?

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:52.450
If you kill me, there is no telling 
what may happen to Sosuke!

00:13:52.940 --> 00:13:55.680
I won't let Sosuke die. Never!

00:13:56.420 --> 00:13:59.630
It's depressing how you 
harp on about Sosuke!

00:14:00.340 --> 00:14:02.440
And here I'm Sosuke now...

00:14:11.850 --> 00:14:13.200
Look at this!

00:14:13.680 --> 00:14:16.390
It would seem the time is almost ripe.

00:14:17.140 --> 00:14:20.200
We must build this 
barrier to completion!

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:20.710
Rooster Monkey Goat Snake Horse

00:14:24.650 --> 00:14:29.990
Isn't that where the church you 
ordered to be shut down is located?

00:14:30.780 --> 00:14:34.220
Unearthly beings are 
currently gathering there.

00:14:35.410 --> 00:14:37.730
Naturally, that is our intent.

00:14:38.250 --> 00:14:39.790
What do you mean?

00:14:40.250 --> 00:14:43.380
After great deliberation,

00:14:43.380 --> 00:14:45.590
in order to obtain a new barrier,

00:14:45.590 --> 00:14:47.030
we have decided to make

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:49.770
a spirit sacrifice rather 
than a human sacrifice.

00:14:50.340 --> 00:14:52.740
You're sacrificing spirits 
to create a barrier...?

00:14:53.640 --> 00:14:58.770
Church Headquarters must stand 
strong as an unwavering force

00:14:58.770 --> 00:15:02.270
to support the hearts of 
the people at all times.

00:15:03.980 --> 00:15:05.840
As such, it is imperative that

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:08.720
the Church be surrounded 
by a powerful barrier.

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:12.140
To meet those ends, you would 
let innocent lives fall

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:14.500
to the hands of these spirits...?

00:15:15.240 --> 00:15:16.770
It is truly tragic...

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:20.770
Sacrifices must be made 
for the greater good!

00:15:22.630 --> 00:15:23.790
Excuse me.

00:15:29.430 --> 00:15:31.270
Shino went to the Old 
Castle District...?

00:15:32.090 --> 00:15:33.430
I'll be taking my leave.

00:15:34.100 --> 00:15:35.360
Stop right there.

00:15:39.690 --> 00:15:43.290
Do you intend to destroy the barrier 
when its completion is soon at hand?

00:15:43.860 --> 00:15:45.290
That would prove somewhat...

00:15:46.360 --> 00:15:48.030
...unfortunate.

00:15:50.400 --> 00:15:51.300
Shinobu!

00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:04.310
Daikaku!

00:16:11.010 --> 00:16:12.610
It's one after the next...!

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:20.120
Natsume, I appreciate your help!

00:16:20.600 --> 00:16:23.870
Don't use your evil 
eye on me by mistake!

00:16:25.310 --> 00:16:28.090
I believe you will keep 
me from growing too bored.

00:16:31.150 --> 00:16:32.350
Damn it!

00:16:32.350 --> 00:16:33.760
Shino, are you okay?!

00:16:34.450 --> 00:16:36.260
Genpachi! Kobungo!

00:16:36.660 --> 00:16:39.010
That brings us to seven...

00:16:47.290 --> 00:16:48.250
Sheesh!

00:16:48.820 --> 00:16:50.940
You let those monsters in here?

00:16:51.380 --> 00:16:53.820
Princess, what were you thinking?

00:16:59.390 --> 00:17:00.200
Shinobu!

00:17:04.600 --> 00:17:05.580
It couldn't be...!

00:17:07.520 --> 00:17:08.400
Why...?

00:17:10.780 --> 00:17:11.820
Hazuki?

00:17:14.150 --> 00:17:17.480
Shinobu, that is no longer 
Hazuki standing before you.

00:17:17.910 --> 00:17:18.720
No...!

00:17:19.160 --> 00:17:21.220
Shinobu, fight!

00:17:21.500 --> 00:17:23.020
That isn't Hazuki!

00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:25.170
He can't!

00:17:25.420 --> 00:17:27.090
Even if he knows it isn't him,

00:17:27.090 --> 00:17:31.220
he can't bring himself to fight 
someone who resembles Hazuki!

00:17:34.630 --> 00:17:38.370
Once a bond has been forged, 
it is not easily broken.

00:17:38.970 --> 00:17:40.560
Isn't that right, Shino?

00:17:50.480 --> 00:17:51.250
Shino...

00:18:05.830 --> 00:18:08.830
Once all eight gems have assembled,

00:18:08.830 --> 00:18:11.130
the cursed soul shall awaken;

00:18:11.800 --> 00:18:13.930
destiny will set down its course.

00:18:15.050 --> 00:18:17.010
It would seem they have come together.

00:18:17.010 --> 00:18:19.490
All eight Dog Warriors and 
their eight gems are here!

00:18:19.970 --> 00:18:20.950
What?!

00:18:21.510 --> 00:18:23.310
There are only seven gems here!

00:18:23.930 --> 00:18:26.250
Guys, are you all right?!

00:18:26.940 --> 00:18:29.750
Now that I'm here, you can rest at ease!

00:18:30.440 --> 00:18:33.400
Dosetsu Inuyama is barging in!

00:18:35.860 --> 00:18:37.310
That was horrible.

00:18:37.310 --> 00:18:39.940
He has the worst possible 
timing imaginable...

00:18:40.780 --> 00:18:42.390
Why did you have to come now?

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:44.840
My prey seems to have fallen

00:18:44.840 --> 00:18:47.140
into my hands sooner than anticipated.

00:18:52.450 --> 00:18:53.400
What?!

00:19:05.980 --> 00:19:07.330
What's going on?

00:19:13.570 --> 00:19:16.400
The time is ripe!

00:19:23.080 --> 00:19:24.240
Sosuke?!

00:19:24.790 --> 00:19:28.040
His hand! It suddenly 
started to get cold!

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:29.710
Sosuke...!

00:19:29.710 --> 00:19:31.130
This isn't good!

00:19:31.130 --> 00:19:33.420
His soul is being torn out of his body!

00:19:33.960 --> 00:19:35.380
Sosuke!

00:19:51.650 --> 00:19:52.960
Snow Princess!

00:19:53.940 --> 00:19:54.960
Murasame?!

00:19:55.770 --> 00:19:56.940
Yana's Seal...!

00:19:57.740 --> 00:19:58.470
Natsume...!

00:19:58.470 --> 00:19:59.370
Shinobu!

00:20:00.820 --> 00:20:01.970
What in the...?

00:20:04.070 --> 00:20:08.580
While in this barrier, you 
cannot use your powers.

00:20:09.910 --> 00:20:15.070
Only those who have received my 
blessings can exert their powers!

00:20:24.870 --> 00:20:25.870
Shino!

00:20:26.310 --> 00:20:27.110
Shino!

00:20:33.100 --> 00:20:35.750
Come! Show yourself, Princess Fuse!

00:20:36.690 --> 00:20:40.790
The time has come for me 
to absorb you into my body

00:20:40.790 --> 00:20:44.130
and throw this land into 
the darkness of the Abyss!

00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:53.390
Give back... Sosuke's... gem...!

00:21:00.130 --> 00:21:02.320
The strength of your will...

00:21:03.260 --> 00:21:06.560
It would make you a most 
fitting vessel for my child!

00:21:09.060 --> 00:21:11.040
Princess, that water...!

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:12.230
Don't!

00:21:19.730 --> 00:21:22.750
That water was meant for 
naught but to turn you

00:21:22.750 --> 00:21:24.100
into the vessel for my child.

00:21:24.700 --> 00:21:28.650
It is a sacred water that 
buries the soul deep within.

00:21:29.580 --> 00:21:33.780
Transient soul, sink deep 
within his depths...

00:21:39.090 --> 00:21:40.130
I can't...

00:21:40.590 --> 00:21:45.320
